    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That \"one-size-fits-all\" point is huge. It feels like these global bodies try to impose Western-centric values on everyone else under the guise of \"universal human rights.\" Do you think there's any actual way for these organizations to respect sovereignty, or are they fundamentally designed to erode it?",
