      "content": "I get that, but it seems like the \"consensus-building\" you mentioned is just a euphemism for letting powerful blocs dictate terms to smaller nations. If these organizations are basically just tools for the most influential players to override the autonomy of others, isn't it more accurate to say that global governance is inherently an anti-sovereignty project?",
